{ "Identifier":           {"ImplementerID": "1", "ImplementationID": "CAE-AOE-V1.0-I01", "AIMName": "1CAE-AOE-V1.0-I01"},
  "Header":               "CAE-AOE-V1.0",

  "APIProfile":           "Basic",
  "Description":          "Audio Object Editing. One Basic Audio Object is open at a time, so a User Command need not name it: a Basic Audio Object arriving is opened - from Shared Storage, by its identifier - or, new (a sound the User Agent captured), created. The User Command modifies what it is like (ModifiedObjects: the Object part of the Acoustic Profile; LUFS) and where it is heard from (UserPoV, also on its own Port). Every edit is a new version in Shared Storage. Outputs: the open Basic Audio Object, to the Module and to Audio Scene Editing, and the User Command, with its report half (UserCommandReport) saying how each action was executed.",

  "InternalTypes":        [],

